WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00.520 --> 00:04.450
Goal setting is everywhere around us.
By this point in your life,

2
00:04.810 --> 00:06.720
you've probably set various goals:

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.830
exercise three times a week,

4
00:09.410 --> 00:11.270
meet your quarterly targets at work,

5
00:11.910 --> 00:13.030
learn a new language.

6
00:14.470 --> 00:21.540
You've also probably experienced how setting intentions
for yourself improves the likelihood that you'll make those things happen.

7
00:22.250 --> 00:27.110
What you might not know is that one of the areas
in which this is most true is learning.

8
00:27.880 --> 00:32.320
Whether you're leading a team for the first time
or joining a challenging project,

9
00:32.930 --> 00:36.800
countless studies have shown
that setting a clear learning intention

10
00:36.800 --> 00:41.060
can make the learning process
more efficient, fun, and successful.

11
00:41.610 --> 00:45.990
And yet there are three big things that hold
many of us back when it comes to learning.

12
00:46.790 --> 00:53.540
One is that we often focus more on a specific performance goal
when we should be focusing on the learning journey itself.

13
00:54.280 --> 00:59.780
In addition, we often set learning intentions
that are not actually meaningful for us.

14
01:00.520 --> 01:02.880
We'll talk more about those two ideas later.

15
01:03.330 --> 01:09.030
But the biggest mistake of all is that we often
just don't take the time to set any kind of intention.

16
01:09.670 --> 01:14.370
So why does the mere act of setting intentions
have such a great impact on learning?

17
01:15.050 --> 01:16.100
It's simple, really.

18
01:16.420 --> 01:19.490
Our brains only have so much attention they can give.

19
01:20.100 --> 01:24.670
We live in a complex world with more stimuli
than we can possibly process.

20
01:25.350 --> 01:33.060
Being purposeful with intentions helps us to cut through the noise
and stay focused on what we've identified as personally important.

21
01:33.960 --> 01:37.630
This focus helps us not only to envision a final outcome,

22
01:38.050 --> 01:43.170
but also to navigate the learning journey,
evaluating and changing course as needed.

23
01:43.910 --> 01:49.760
When you inevitably face a challenge, or don't succeed
the first or second or third time,

24
01:50.310 --> 01:57.060
that energy you focused on your intention will help you
find a way through that challenge and to continue onwards.

25
01:57.700 --> 02:01.470
And along the way, you'll be more likely
to enjoy the journey itself.

26
02:02.600 --> 02:05.410
So, whether you're learning a new technical skill

27
02:05.890 --> 02:08.200
or learning to be a better manager,

28
02:08.200 --> 02:14.660
setting learning intentions will help you realize your vision,
improve your experience, and make it meaningful,

29
02:15.270 --> 02:17.700
which makes the learning even more powerful.
